# No automatic git push

- Do **not** run `git push` (or any remote publish such as `gh-pages -d dist`) unless the user explicitly asks to push, publish, or deploy.
- Commits are also only when explicitly requested.
- After committing locally (when asked), stop and report status — leave pushing to the user unless they also asked to push.
